@collector = http://localhost:5001
@personelId = P-1001
@canonicalWorkId = 1

### Generate or reuse a saved evidence-bound specialist review
POST {{collector}}/Services/AcademicPerformance/V1/ReviewCanonicalArticle
Content-Type: application/json

{"personelID":"{{personelId}}","canonicalWorkId":{{canonicalWorkId}},"language":"tr","forceRegeneration":false}

### Explicitly append a new manual run for the current base analysis
POST {{collector}}/Services/AcademicPerformance/V1/ReviewCanonicalArticle
Content-Type: application/json

{"personelID":"{{personelId}}","canonicalWorkId":{{canonicalWorkId}},"language":"tr","forceRegeneration":true}

### Read the latest saved review and its staleness; no model call or write
POST {{collector}}/Services/AcademicPerformance/V1/GetCanonicalArticleReview
Content-Type: application/json

{"personelID":"{{personelId}}","canonicalWorkId":{{canonicalWorkId}},"language":"tr"}
